    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two Christmases",
     "texto": [
      "In December, Danes go to several **julefrokoster**: very long lunches with colleagues or friends (herring, cheese, **snaps** and songs).\n\nThe «real» Christmas is on **24 December (juleaften)**: a family dinner, dancing around the tree and presents that very same night."
     ],
     "tutora": "contenta"
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
