    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Dancing around the tree",
     "texto": [
      "After dinner, the tree (**juletræet**) is placed in the middle of the living room with the candles lit. Everyone holds hands, **danser om juletræet** and sings carols. Afterwards, the presents: **en ad gangen**, one by one."
     ],
     "tutora": "contenta"
    }
